questions.analysis:
解：1、实验室系中

$$
p_1\cdot p_2=\frac{m_1m_2}{\sqrt{1-v_{10}^2}}\tag{①}
$$

$$
\therefore\ v_{10}=\sqrt{1-\left(\frac{m_1m_2}{p_1\cdot p_2}\right)^2}\tag{②}
$$

2、任意系中

$$
p_1\cdot p_2=E_1E_2(1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2)=m_1m_2\frac{1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2}{\sqrt{1-v_1^2}\sqrt{1-v_2^2}}\tag{③}
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\therefore\quad v_{10}&=\frac{\sqrt{(1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2)^2-(1-v_1^2)(1-v_2^2)}}{1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2}\\
&=\frac{\sqrt{(\vec{v}_1-\vec{v}_2)^2-(\vec{v}_1\times\vec{v}_2)^2}}{1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2}
\end{aligned}\tag{④}
$$

因此，

$$
g(\vec{v}_1,\vec{v}_2)=\frac{1}{1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2}\tag{⑤}
$$

3、按照定义 $dN$、$\sigma$ 和 $v_{10}$ 均为 Lorentz 不变量，而

$$
dt_0=\sqrt{1-v_2^2}\,dt.\tag{⑥}
$$

$$
n_{10}=\frac{\sqrt{1-v_1^2}}{\sqrt{1-v_{10}^2}}n_1\tag{⑦}
$$

因此，

$$
\begin{aligned}
dN&=\sigma v_{10}n_{10}dt_0=\frac{\sqrt{1-v_1^2}\sqrt{1-v_2^2}}{\sqrt{1-v_{10}^2}}v_{10}\sigma n_1dt_0\\
&=p_1\cdot p_2\frac{\sqrt{1-v_1^2}\sqrt{1-v_2^2}}{m_1m_2}v_{10}\sigma n_1dt=\frac{p_1\cdot p_2}{E_1E_2}v_{10}\sigma n_1dt=(1-\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2)v_{10}\sigma n_1dt\\
&=\sqrt{(\vec{v}_1-\vec{v}_2)^2-(\vec{v}_1\times\vec{v}_2)^2}\,\sigma n_1dt\tag{⑧}
\end{aligned}
$$

故有

$$
f(\vec{v}_1,\vec{v}_2)=\sqrt{(\vec{v}_1-\vec{v}_2)^2-(\vec{v}_1\times\vec{v}_2)^2}\tag{⑨}
$$
